|---|---|---|\n| 2000 random value states | 1975 numbered, 25 refused, 0 invariance failures, 0 decode failures | 2000 numbered, 0 refused, max 13 trials |\n| 200 frame-bearing states | 192 numbered, 8 refused, 0 failures | 200 numbered, 0 refused |\n| 100 states with children | 98 numbered, 2 refused, 0 failures | 100 numbered, 0 refused |\n\nEvery earlier pin reproduced under the rank spelling and with D6 on. Under D6 the 2-cycle and 3-cycle reach 6a's exact roots. Key bytes at a 65536-character descriptor fell from 920118 to 1396. 6a's own tests still pass in the probe project (21 tests, 324 assertions).\n\n**Caveats**\n\n- The `clojure` launcher and bare `java` needed an approval this session could not give, so the JVM ran via `mise exec -- java` on the cached classpath. Git status could not be queried for the same reason, but no git write command was issued.\n- Three-host runs, kondo and real budget charging in the codec remain unrun. The real-state conflict rate is still unmeasured, which under D6 is a cost question only.\n\n**Verdict:** READY for an implementation brief cut from section 8, pending the owner's choice between D6 (recommended) and the D5 variant."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":256466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":457},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7984b61f-639f-4af2-b00a-5b9b7d554f75","uuid":"e0214d2e-98d4-4b20-9c1c-333b437943c7","timestamp":"2026-10-12T06:51:55.183Z","request_id":"req_011CfwuB5bjKciUZDN9H5sNa"}
